    "MissionGiver": "Citizens for Prosperity",
    "Title": "Alliance Aid: Security Needed",
    "TitleKey": "CleanAir_EscortShip_Medium_title",
    "Description": "I was just contacted by an Alliance Aid rep who is deeply concerned for one of their contractors heading out from  <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4>. The ships helping the relief effort have been drawing a lot of outlaw attention and they're worried that without extra protection they won't be able to finish their vital work.  \n\nOwing with the increased risk level and the value of the ship, it might behoove you to <EM4>bring some combat support</EM4> of your own along.\n\nIf you\u2019re interested, head to the rendezvous and await further instructions.\n\nLima Endicott\nLead Dispatcher\nCitizens for Prosperity",
    "DescriptionKey": "CleanAir_EscortShip_Medium_desc",
    "DisplayDescription": "I was just contacted by an Alliance Aid rep who is deeply concerned for one of their contractors heading out from  <EM4>Asteroid Mining Base</EM4>. The ships helping the relief effort have been drawing a lot of outlaw attention and they're worried that without extra protection they won't be able to finish their vital work.  \n\nOwing with the increased risk level and the value of the ship, it might behoove you to <EM4>bring some combat support</EM4> of your own along.\n\nIf you\u2019re interested, head to the rendezvous and await further instructions.\n\nLima Endicott\nLead Dispatcher\nCitizens for Prosperity",
